Package: aobcore
Title: Lean Core for 'allonboard' Map Scenes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Michael", "Sumner", , "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds renderer-neutral map scenes that are drawn in their own
    coordinate reference system, with polar views as the first-class case.
    Data are carried as native 'GeoArrow' and grid descriptors. This is an
    early skeleton; the package name is a placeholder.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/allboa/aobcore
BugReports: https://github.com/allboa/aobcore/issues
Imports:
    geoarrow,
    htmltools,
    nanoarrow,
    wk
Suggests:
    gdalraster,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
